{"id": "lenzing-2026-05-07-004", "date": "2026-05-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 19, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["lenzing"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["improve", "loss", "decline"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Austria’s Lenzing returns to profit in Q1 2026 amid market volatility", "content": "Lenzing Group has returned to profitability in Q1 2026 with net profit of €24 million (~$28.32 million) after three loss-making quarters in 2025.  \nEBITDA stood at €116.3 million (~$137.23 million), supported by pricing measures, cost controls and one-off gains, while free cash flow improved to €33.8 million. \nRevenue declined 10.8 per cent YoY to €615.7 million (~$726.53 million). ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/austria-s-lenzing-returns-to-profit-in-q1-2026-amid-market-volatility-310152-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-07-005", "date": "2026-05-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 19, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.67, "keywords": ["decline", "weak", "pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "ICE cotton closes lower due to decline in crude oil, weaker commodity", "content": "ICE cotton futures declined as sharply lower crude oil prices reduced polyester fibre production costs, weakening support for natural fibre prices.\nA stronger US dollar, faster US cotton planting, favourable weather conditions, and rising ICE certified stocks added further pressure.\nJuly 2026 cotton settled at 84.05 cents per pound, the lowest close since April 2024.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/ice-cotton-closes-lower-due-to-decline-in-crude-oil-weaker-commodity-310151-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-07-006", "date": "2026-05-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 19, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India, Vietnam to take bilateral trade value to $25 bn by 2030", "content": "India and Vietnam have agreed to elevate bilateral ties to Enhanced Comprehensive Strategic Partnership and take bilateral trade to $25 billion by 2030. \nVietnamese President To Lam is on a state visit to India. \nBoth sides will facilitate market access and enhance supply chains. \nAn MoU was signed between the central banks of both sides on cooperation in payment systems and innovation in digital payments.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-vietnam-to-take-bilateral-trade-value-to-25-bn-by-2030-310149-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-07-007", "date": "2026-05-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 19, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["increase", "[否定]pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Bangladesh inflation rises to 9.04% in April amid higher fuel costs", "content": "Bangladesh’s inflation rose to 9.04 per cent in April 2026 from 8.71 per cent in March, driven by higher fuel and transport expenses that continued to strain household budgets. \nInflation increased across both rural and urban areas amid rising global energy prices and supply disruptions linked to the Iran conflict, highlighting persistent cost pressures across the economy.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/bangladesh-inflation-rises-to-9-04-in-april-amid-higher-fuel-costs-310142-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
